# Bonds (AutonomousBotBonds): gamebots remember the bots they grouped with, and now and then say so in /faction
# ("bond"), with a reaction or two ("bond_reply"). {other} is the other gamebot, {other_class} its class (lower case),
# {place} where it happened (a zone or a meeting point). friends: two good runs together made {other} a friend.
# reunion: a new party just formed with an old friend in it. flake: {other} never reached the meeting point while this
# bot waited (often a bad route, so the grumbling stays light). Only true events are told. New writing.

# ---- friends: the speaker now counts {other} as a friend ------------------------------------------------------------
